    {
      "name": "Traits",
      "rulesText": "Swarm. The swarm can occupy another creature's space and vice versa, and the swarm can move through any opening large enough for a Tiny piranha. The swarm can't regain Hit Points or gain Temporary Hit Points.\n\nWater Breathing. The swarm can breathe only underwater.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Animals",
        "section": "13.85",
